---
import ProsePage from "../layouts/ProsePage.astro";

const title = "About Blankie";
const description =
  "Blankie is a free, open-source ambient sound mixer for iPhone, iPad, Mac and CarPlay, made by independent developer Cody Bromley.";
---

<ProsePage title={title} description={description}>
  <p>
    Blankie is a free, open-source ambient sound mixer for iPhone, iPad, Mac and
    CarPlay. Turn on sounds like rain, ocean waves or a crackling fireplace, set
    each one to its own volume and let the mix play while you sleep, focus or
    unwind. It's made by independent developer <a
      href="https://github.com/codybrom">Cody Bromley</a
    > and inspired by <a href="https://apps.gnome.org/Blanket/">Blanket</a>, the
    free, open-source Linux app by Rafael Mardojai and contributors.
  </p>

  <h2>What Blankie stands for</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Free for everyone, forever.</strong> Blankie was <a
        href="/guides/why-is-blankie-free/">built on the idea</a
      > that it's hard to fully relax if you're being charged, bombarded with ads
      or having your privacy invaded. Every feature is included, with no ads, subscriptions
      or in-app purchases.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Your data stays yours.</strong> There's no account, no analytics and
      no tracking. Every sound is bundled in the app, so it plays offline, and your
      presets, settings and imported sounds never leave your device.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Open to everyone.</strong> The code for the app and this website is
      on <a href="https://github.com/codybrom/blankie">GitHub</a>, so anyone can
      read it, change it or help make it better.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Credit where it's due.</strong> Blankie is built on openly licensed
      sounds, volunteer translations and other open-source projects. Everyone who
      made them is named on the <a href="/credits/">Credits</a> page, and keeping
      Blankie free is how that generosity gets passed along.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who uses it</h2>

  <p>
    Blankie has been downloaded more than 25,000 times, and schools and
    organizations have deployed it to more than 1,000 devices through Apple
    School Manager and Apple Business Manager. It's available in 12 languages
    and keeps getting better thanks to contributors and translators around the
    world.
  </p>

  <h2>Learn more</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><a href="/guides/get-started/">Get Started with Blankie</a></li>
    <li><a href="/faq/">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
    <li><a href="/press/">Press kit</a></li>
    <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></li>
    <li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></li>
  </ul>
</ProsePage>
